    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Critical points are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>but&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;is making a zero twice in product so, points of non&nbsp;differentiability are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Number of points of non-differentiability&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p>",
